| Odysseus (meta-repo) | 4-submodule delegation: AchaeanFleet, ProjectProteus, Mnemosyne, ProjectHephaestus — 2-wave myrmidon swarm, 2026-04-05 | Wave 1: 3 Sonnet agents added/verified submodule recipes in parallel (~70s); Wave 2: 1 Sonnet agent added Odysseus delegation recipes + pin updates (~120s); verified with `just --list` |

